OL,3,ABritish national arrested in connection
OL,4,Awith RAF Fairford incident
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 22-year-old British national has been
OL,7,Farrested on suspicion of preparation of
OL,8,Fterrorist acts in connection with an
OL,9,Fincident close to RAF Fairford,
OL,10,Fcounter-terror police said.
OL,12,FHe was arrested in Westminster, London,
OL,13,Fon Tuesday as part of the investigation
OL,14,Finto the incident near the airbase in
OL,15,FGloucestershire on 27 September.
OL,17,FIt is the seventh arrest in connection
OL,18,Fto the incident but no one has been
OL,19,Fcharged.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
